---
// VSL de registro — página STANDALONE con diseño propio.
// No usa BaseLayout ni el CSS del template a propósito (es una landing de anuncios).
// Los CTAs (href="/agenda") abren el popup de GoHighLevel vía JS al final.
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>SpaCar Academy — Sistema Llave en Mano para Detailing</title>
  <link rel="icon" href="/images/icon.webp" type="image/webp" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link
    href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Barlow+Condensed:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;0,700;0,800;0,900;1,700;1,900&family=DM+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap"
    rel="stylesheet" />
  <style is:global>
    :root {
      --ink: #0B0B0E;
      --surface: #15151B;
      --surface-2: #1C1C24;
      --line: rgba(255, 255, 255, .09);
      --cyan: #35BAEE;
      --magenta: #E5168E;
      --magenta-deep: #C8007C;
      --yellow: #FFD23F;
      --text: #F4F4F6;
      --muted: #9A9AA6;
      --blue: #35BAEE;
    }

    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

    body {
      background: var(--ink);
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
      font-size: 17px;
      line-height: 1.7;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    .container { max-width: 1140px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; }
    .container-sm { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; }

    section { padding: 84px 0; }

    /* ─── Highlights ─── */
    .hl-y { color: var(--cyan); font-style: normal; }
    .hl-r { color: var(--magenta); font-style: normal; }

    /* ─── Headings ─── */
    .sh {
      font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
      font-weight: 800;
      line-height: 1.04;
      letter-spacing: .005em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .sh-md { font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 40px); }
    .sh-lg { font-size: clamp(34px, 5.4vw, 58px); }
    .sh-xl { font-size: clamp(40px, 6.6vw, 76px); }

    .eyebrow {
      font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: .22em;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: var(--cyan);
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    /* ─── Buttons ─── */
    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
      font-weight: 800;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: .03em;
      font-size: 20px;
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 18px 38px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      cursor: pointer;
      border: none;
      transition: transform .15s ease, box-shadow .2s ease, background .2s ease;
      line-height: 1.1;
    }
    .btn.lg { font-size: 23px; padding: 22px 46px; }
    .btn-yellow {
      background: var(--yellow);
      color: #15130a;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(255, 210, 63, .22);
    }
    .btn-yellow:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 16px 40px rgba(255, 210, 63, .32); }
    .btn-red {
      background: var(--magenta);
      color: #fff;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(229, 22, 142, .26);
    }
    .btn-red:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 16px 40px rgba(229, 22, 142, .36); }
    .btn-dark {
      display: inline-block;
      font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
      font-weight: 800;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: .03em;
      font-size: 21px;
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 20px 44px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      background: var(--ink);
      color: var(--text);
      border: 1.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18);
      transition: transform .15s ease, border-color .2s ease;
    }
    .btn-dark:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); border-color: var(--cyan); }

    /* ─── Dividers ─── */
    .divider { height: 1px; background: var(--line); }
    .divider-yellow { height: 3px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--cyan), var(--magenta)); }

    /* ═══ HERO ═══ */
    .hero {
      padding: 60px 0 72px;
      background:
        radial-gradient(70% 55% at 50% 0%, rgba(53, 186, 238, .12), transparent 70%),
        radial-gradient(60% 50% at 80% 20%, rgba(229, 22, 142, .10), transparent 70%);
    }
    .hero-inner { text-align: center; max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .hero-badge {
      display: inline-block;
      background: var(--surface-2);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 100px;
      padding: 9px 22px;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: var(--muted);
      margin-bottom: 30px;
      letter-spacing: .01em;
    }
    .hero-badge .hl-y { font-weight: 700; }
    .hero-headline {
      font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
      font-weight: 900;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-size: clamp(38px, 7vw, 80px);
      line-height: .98;
      letter-spacing: .005em;
      margin-bottom: 26px;
    }
    .hero-rule { width: 80px; height: 4px; background: var(--magenta); margin: 0 auto 26px; border-radius: 2px; }
    .hero-body { font-size: clamp(17px, 2.2vw, 22px); color: #d6d6dd; max-width: 680px; margin: 0 auto 14px; }
    .hero-body .hl-y, .hero-body .hl-r { font-weight: 700; }

    .step-label-wrap { margin: 38px 0 18px; }
    .step-label {
      font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 21px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: .04em;
      color: var(--text);
    }
    .step-label .step-num { color: var(--magenta); font-weight: 800; }
    .step-label em { font-style: italic; color: var(--cyan); }

    .hero-video-wrap {
      max-width: 780px;
      margin: 0 auto 34px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      overflow: hidden;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      box-shadow: 0 30px 80px rgba(0, 0, 0, .5);
      background: #000;
      position: relative;
      aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
    }
    .hero-video-wrap video,
    .hero-video-wrap iframe {
      position: absolute;
      top: 0; left: 0;
      width: 100%; height: 100%;
      display: block; border: 0;
      object-fit: cover;
    }

    .hero-trust { color: var(--muted); font-size: 15px; margin-top: 18px; }
    .hero-trust span { color: var(--cyan); font-weight: 700; }

    /* ═══ HOOK ═══ */
    .hook-section { background: var(--surface); }
    .hook-inner { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.2fr .8fr; gap: 56px; align-items: center; }
    .hook-headline { margin-bottom: 22px; }
    .hook-body { font-size: 20px; color: #d6d6dd; margin-bottom: 30px; }
    .hook-body .hl-y { font-weight: 700; }
    .hook-quotes { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; }
    .hook-quote {
      display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px;
      background: var(--surface-2);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 15px 18px;
      font-size: 16px;
      color: #e3e3e9;
    }
    .hook-quote strong { color: var(--cyan); }
    .hq-icon { color: var(--magenta); font-weight: 800; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 18px; }
    .hook-video-frame {
      border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      box-shadow: 0 24px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, .5);
      background: #000; aspect-ratio: 9 / 16; max-width: 320px; margin: 0 auto;
      position: relative;
    }
    .hook-video-frame video,
    .hook-video-frame iframe {
      position: absolute;
      top: 0; left: 0;
      width: 100%; height: 100%;
      display: block; border: 0;
      object-fit: cover;
    }

    /* ═══ MARQUEE ═══ */
    .marquee-wrap { overflow: hidden; background: var(--magenta-deep); padding: 16px 0; white-space: nowrap; }
    .marquee-track { display: inline-flex; animation: marquee 32s linear infinite; }
    .marquee-item {
      font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
      font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .04em;
      font-size: 19px; color: #fff; padding: 0 4px;
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 22px;
    }
    .marquee-dot { color: var(--yellow); margin: 0 18px; }
    @keyframes marquee { from { transform: translateX(0); } to { transform: translateX(-50%); } }

    /* ═══ INTRO ═══ */
    .intro-text { text-align: center; }
    .intro-body { font-size: clamp(22px, 3vw, 30px); font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.4; }
    .intro-body strong { color: var(--cyan); }

    /* ═══ STATS ═══ */
    .year-strip {
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px 4px;
    }
    .stat-block { text-align: center; padding: 0 28px; }
    .stat-num {
      font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 900;
      font-size: clamp(38px, 5.5vw, 60px); line-height: 1;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--cyan), var(--magenta));
      -webkit-background-clip: text; background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    }
    .stat-lbl { font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .12em; margin-top: 8px; font-weight: 600; }
    .stat-sep { font-size: 38px; color: var(--line); font-weight: 200; }

    /* ═══ MODULES ═══ */
    .discover-head { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 54px; }
    .modules-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 26px; }
    .module-card {
      background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; display: flex; flex-direction: column;
      transition: transform .25s ease, border-color .25s ease;
    }
    .module-card:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); border-color: rgba(53,186,238,.4); }
    .module-img { aspect-ratio: 16 / 10; overflow: hidden; }
    .module-img img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }
    .module-body { padding: 28px 26px 30px; position: relative; }
    .module-num {
      position: absolute; top: -26px; left: 26px;
      width: 52px; height: 52px; border-radius: 12px;
      background: var(--magenta); color: #fff;
      font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-size: 28px;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(229, 22, 142, .4);
    }
    .module-title {
      font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 25px; line-height: 1.1; text-transform: uppercase;
      margin: 14px 0 12px;
    }
    .module-lead { color: var(--muted); font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .module-lead strong { color: var(--cyan); }
    .check-list { list-style: none; margin-top: 10px; }
    .check-list li { position: relative; padding-left: 28px; margin-bottom: 9px; font-size: 15.5px; color: #d6d6dd; }
    .check-list li::before { content: "✓"; position: absolute; left: 0; color: var(--cyan); font-weight: 800; }
    .check-list li strong { color: var(--cyan); }

    /* ═══ ABOUT ═══ */
    .about { background: var(--surface); }
    .about-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: .85fr 1.15fr; gap: 54px; align-items: start; }
    .about-img { position: relative; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .about-img img { width: 100%; display: block; }
    .about-img-caption {
      position: absolute; bottom: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
      background: linear-gradient(transparent, rgba(0,0,0,.9));
      padding: 40px 22px 20px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600;
    }
    .about-img-caption span { display: block; color: var(--cyan); font-size: 13px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .12em; margin-bottom: 4px; }
    .about-text { font-size: 17px; color: #d6d6dd; margin-bottom: 18px; }
    .about-text strong { color: var(--text); }
    .errors-box { background: var(--ink); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 26px; margin: 24px 0; }
    .errors-title { font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 19px; letter-spacing: .03em; margin-bottom: 14px; color: var(--magenta); }
    .errors-list { list-style: none; }
    .errors-list li { padding: 7px 0; font-size: 16.5px; color: #e3e3e9; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }
    .err-icon { color: var(--magenta); font-weight: 800; }

    /* ═══ WHO ═══ */
    .who-head { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 50px; }
    .who-head-big {
      font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 800;
      text-transform: uppercase; font-size: clamp(26px, 4vw, 44px); line-height: 1.05;
    }
    .who-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 22px; }
    .who-card { background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 16px; padding: 30px 28px; transition: border-color .25s ease, transform .25s ease; }
    .who-card:hover { border-color: rgba(53,186,238,.4); transform: translateY(-4px); }
    .who-num {
      font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-size: 40px;
      color: var(--cyan); line-height: 1; margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    .who-title { font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 24px; text-transform: uppercase; line-height: 1.1; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .who-body { color: var(--muted); font-size: 16px; }
    .who-note {
      text-align: center; margin-top: 34px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 16px;
      background: var(--surface); border: 1px dashed rgba(229,22,142,.4); border-radius: 12px; padding: 18px 24px; max-width: 720px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;
    }
    .who-note strong { color: var(--magenta); }

    /* ═══ BREAK ═══ */
    .break-section {
      text-align: center;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--cyan), var(--magenta));
      padding: 72px 0;
    }
    .break-section .sh { color: #fff; }
    .break-section p { color: rgba(255,255,255,.92); font-size: 19px; margin: 16px 0 32px; font-weight: 500; }

    /* ═══ FINAL CTA ═══ */
    .final-cta {
      background:
        radial-gradient(60% 60% at 50% 0%, rgba(53, 186, 238, .14), transparent 70%),
        radial-gradient(50% 50% at 50% 100%, rgba(229, 22, 142, .12), transparent 70%);
      text-align: center;
    }
    .final-cta-sub { font-size: 19px; color: #d6d6dd; margin: 18px 0 32px; }
    .final-cta-sub strong { color: var(--cyan); }
    .final-trust { color: var(--muted); font-size: 15px; margin-top: 20px; }
    .final-trust span { color: var(--cyan); font-weight: 700; }

    /* ═══ FOOTER ═══ */
    footer { text-align: center; padding: 54px 24px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--ink); }
    .logo-img { height: 46px; margin-bottom: 18px; opacity: .95; }
    footer p { color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px; margin: 4px 0; }
    footer a { color: var(--cyan); text-decoration: none; }
    .footer-disclaimer { max-width: 720px; margin: 20px auto 0; font-size: 12px; color: #50505a; line-height: 1.6; }

    /* ═══ RESPONSIVE ═══ */
    @media (max-width: 880px) {
      .hook-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 40px; }
      .hook-video-frame { order: -1; }
      .modules-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .about-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 36px; }
      .who-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .stat-sep { display: none; }
      .year-strip { gap: 28px 0; }
      .stat-block { flex: 1 1 40%; }
      section { padding: 64px 0; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 480px) {
      body { font-size: 16px; }
      .btn, .btn.lg { font-size: 18px; padding: 16px 28px; width: 100%; }
      .module-body { padding: 26px 22px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <!-- ═══ HERO ═══ -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="hero-inner">

        <div class="hero-badge">
          <span class="hl-y">SOLO</span> para detailers que <span class="hl-y">ya facturan</span> y quieren escalar sin seguir lavando carros
        </div>

        <h1 class="hero-headline">
          El sistema <span class="hl-y">llave en mano</span> para escalar tu detailing a <span class="hl-r">$25K–$30K</span> al mes sin tocar un solo carro
        </h1>

        <div class="hero-rule"></div>

        <p class="hero-body">
          Dos motores trabajando por ti: uno que te trae <span class="hl-y">clientes en automático</span>
          y otro que hace que el trabajo se ejecute <span class="hl-r">sin que tú metas las manos.</span>
        </p>

        <div class="step-label-wrap">
          <div class="step-label">
            <span class="step-num">PASO 1 DE 2:</span>
            <em>MIRA ESTE VIDEO</em>
            👇
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-video-wrap">
          <iframe src="https://iframe.mediadelivery.net/embed/601796/7aa00669-848e-47a3-b0aa-dec2ec919177?autoplay=false&loop=false&muted=false&preload=true&responsive=true"
            loading="lazy"
            allow="accelerometer;gyroscope;autoplay;encrypted-media;picture-in-picture;fullscreen;"
            allowfullscreen="true"></iframe>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-post-video">
          <a href="/agenda" class="btn btn-yellow lg">QUIERO AGENDAR MI LLAMADA →</a>
          <p class="hero-trust">
            <span>✓</span> Llamada 100% gratuita &nbsp;·&nbsp;
            <span>✓</span> Sin tarjeta de crédito &nbsp;·&nbsp;
            <span>✓</span> Solo para detailers que ya facturan
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="divider"></div>

  <!-- ═══ HOOK / CIERRE EMOCIONAL ═══ -->
  <section class="hook-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="hook-inner">

        <div class="hook-content">
          <div class="eyebrow">La verdad que nadie te dice</div>
          <h2 class="sh sh-lg hook-headline">
            Facturas bien… pero si tú paras, <span class="hl-r">el negocio para.</span>
          </h2>
          <p class="hook-body">
            No tienes una empresa. Te compraste un empleo bien pagado del que <span class="hl-y">no puedes salir.</span>
          </p>
          <div class="hook-quotes">
            <div class="hook-quote">
              <span class="hq-icon">→</span>
              El problema nunca fue lavar mejor. Fue seguir siendo <strong>tú quien lava cada carro</strong>
            </div>
            <div class="hook-quote">
              <span class="hq-icon">→</span>
              Tu techo no se rompe con <strong>más horas</strong> — ya no te quedan
            </div>
            <div class="hook-quote">
              <span class="hq-icon">→</span>
              Se rompe cuando el negocio deja de depender de tus manos…
            </div>
          </div>
          <a href="/agenda" class="btn btn-yellow" style="margin-top:36px; display:inline-block;">
            AGENDA TU LLAMADA AHORA →
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="hook-video-wrap">
          <div class="hook-video-frame">
            <iframe src="https://iframe.mediadelivery.net/embed/601796/67a22620-2356-459d-9076-9cfedf36ba11?autoplay=false&loop=false&muted=false&preload=true&responsive=true"
              loading="lazy"
              allow="accelerometer;gyroscope;autoplay;encrypted-media;picture-in-picture;fullscreen;"
              allowfullscreen="true"></iframe>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ═══ MARQUEE ═══ -->
  <div class="marquee-wrap" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="marquee-track">
      <span class="marquee-item">Sistema de 2 motores <span class="marquee-dot">◆</span></span>
      <span class="marquee-item">Sin tocar un solo carro <span class="marquee-dot">◆</span></span>
      <span class="marquee-item">Clientes en automático <span class="marquee-dot">◆</span></span>
      <span class="marquee-item">Escala a $25K–$30K al mes <span class="marquee-dot">◆</span></span>
      <span class="marquee-item">Implementado contigo en 90 días <span class="marquee-dot">◆</span></span>
      <span class="marquee-item">Para detailers que ya facturan <span class="marquee-dot">◆</span></span>
      <span class="marquee-item">SpaCar Academy <span class="marquee-dot">◆</span></span>
      <span class="marquee-item">Sistema de 2 motores <span class="marquee-dot">◆</span></span>
      <span class="marquee-item">Sin tocar un solo carro <span class="marquee-dot">◆</span></span>
      <span class="marquee-item">Clientes en automático <span class="marquee-dot">◆</span></span>
      <span class="marquee-item">Escala a $25K–$30K al mes <span class="marquee-dot">◆</span></span>
      <span class="marquee-item">Implementado contigo en 90 días <span class="marquee-dot">◆</span></span>
      <span class="marquee-item">Para detailers que ya facturan <span class="marquee-dot">◆</span></span>
      <span class="marquee-item">SpaCar Academy <span class="marquee-dot">◆</span></span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ═══ INTRO TEXT ═══ -->
  <section class="intro-text">
    <div class="container-sm" style="text-align:center;">
      <p class="intro-body">
        En esta llamada voy a mostrarte <strong>el Sistema Llave en Mano para Detailing: los dos motores que convierten tu negocio en una empresa que funciona sin ti.</strong>
      </p>
      <p style="font-size:18px; color:var(--muted); margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:36px;">
        Si ya facturas y estás listo para dejar de ser el cuello de botella…<br />
        haz clic en el botón y reserva tu lugar.
      </p>
      <a href="/agenda" class="btn btn-yellow">QUIERO RESERVAR MI LUGAR ✓</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="divider"></div>

